      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "With \\( u = \\frac{x}{4}, \\; dx = 4\\,du \\), the integral becomes \\( \\int \\frac{9}{16\\left(1 + u^{2}\\right)} \\cdot 4\\,du = \\frac{9}{4} \\int \\frac{du}{1 + u^{2}} \\), which is \\( \\frac{9 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}}{4} + C \\).",
